            "review_title": "Review at Com Nha 1989",
            "review_text": "Mr Thomas\nHoi An, Vietnam421 contributions\n0\nDelicious and clean restaurant in Quy Nhon\nOct 2023 • Family\nThe restaurant serves home-style dishes professionally\nThe location is right at the intersection so it's very convenient and has somewhere to park\nThe space is very cool and airy even though there are quite a few guests\nFast and enthusiastic staff\nThe dish comes up very quickly and is delicious\nDelicious fresh juice\nThe vegetable dishes are very green and delicious\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten October 22, 2023",
