            "review_title": "Review at Com Nha 1989",
            "review_text": "Greg H\nAdelaide, Australia29 contributions\n0\nAuthentic local food\nApr 2019 • Couples\nWe dined here last night on the recommendation of a couple of local people and it was very good. We are visiting from Australia and we were keen to try a good, authentic local place and were pleased with the meal. They have an English menu but the staff don't speak much English and the only criticism is that our table hadn't been wiped down and was quite sticky. But the food was tasty (we shared three courses plus some delicious green vegetables) and for AUD$20 which included two (warm but with ice!) was very good value.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 17, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
