            "review_title": "Review at Com Nha 1989",
            "review_text": "Pulencio99\nTarlac, Philippines322 contributions\n0\nGreat Ambience & Good Food!\nNov 2018 • Couples\nMe & my wife had some squid & spring rolls for a light dinner & a few cans of beer. We were delighted with the dish we ordered as they were very tasty & price are not expensive. It also has a great ambience & the staffs are very accommodating.\nI just hope that sooner or later, their staffs can understand even a little english so that it won't be very difficult to talk to them.\nOverall, it is a great place to dine with your family & friends when you are in Quy Nhon.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 12, 2018",
